# SolarEPC-Pro Phase 2: Expert Edition

## Goal Description
Transform the MVP into a professional-grade engineering tool by integrating industry-standard libraries (`pvlib`), adding Battery Storage (BESS) capabilities, and implementing detailed electrical sizing tools.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **External Data**: We will attempt to use the `pvlib` interface to fetch PVGIS data (free, global). If APIs fail, we fallback to the clear-sky model but with `pvlib` physics.

