## Verification Plan
### Automated Tests
- `test_pvlib_integration.py`: Compare `pvlib` output vs simplified model (expect `pvlib` to be more variable due to weather).
- `test_storage.py`: Verify battery doesn't discharge below DoD.
- `test_electrical.py`: Verify voltage drop calculation against standard formula ($V_d = \frac{2 \cdot L \cdot I \cdot \rho}{A}$).

### Manual Verification
- Run the app, select a location in Europe (for PVGIS coverage), and check if real weather data loads.
- Test the "String Sizing" calculator with standard module specs (Voc, Vmp).
